title = Work priorities
billsTitle = Town bills
intro = Click a priority to cycle from off to 1 through 4. Lower numbers come first. Lv shows skill out of 10. Employment costs {wage} gold per week, paid from your inventory or treasury in Bills.
footer = Logistics enables deliveries without a workplace. Commerce is for the clerk chosen at a shop's Town Records Shelf: they serve the shop by day unless other work is ranked above it. Guards do not perform profession work. Priorities stay saved when employment ends or a bill is overdue.
